# Native Mobile Interface Design

For a native mobile task that changes screens, flows, hierarchy, interaction,
device adaptation or accessibility, read
`.engineer-intelligence/senior/frontend/design/mobile-interface/SKILL.md` and
the Design delivery contract. Pair
`.engineer-intelligence/senior/frontend/mobile/SKILL.md` when it exists;
otherwise follow the target project's mobile instructions and established
framework conventions. This Design-only package does not install Mobile
Engineering. Respect native navigation, safe areas, keyboard/input, touch
targets, platform accessibility and motion preferences. Do not treat a native
app as a shrunken website.

For code-only mobile maintenance or performance work without an interface
decision, do not activate this Design specialization.
